      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Unverified (*)",
      "items": [
        "The AI worker calls Orders over its API, with the job ID as idempotency key",
        "Not yet reverified by the owner: see docs/reverify.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Async by design",
      "items": [
        "The upload returns a job ID at once",
        "Extraction runs in the background",
        "Results arrive by polling, not push",
        "Polling goes through the gateway to the Upload API"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Failure path",
      "items": [
        "A job completes only after Orders accepts the order",
        "Until then the queue redelivers it and the worker retries",
        "The job ID makes a retry safe"
      ]
    }
